    <headline>Yellow Near gale 14-17 m/s The Quark 11/21/2026, 11:00:00 AM - 11/23/2026, 4:00:00 AM</headline>
    <description>Saturday afternoon north 14-17 m/s.; What should I think about?: Pay close attention to the marine forecast and prepare crew and vessel for high winds and seas.
